  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobilizing and strengthening local civil society organizations with improved knowledge and capacity to be agents of change, engaging in regional and national level advocacy on food security and environment-related issues.  Training in advocacy techniques, organising actions, awareness raising campaigns, etc. in order to support, among other relevant issues, the integration of climate change adaptation into plans and programmes. Special attention will be given to children, youth mothers of pre-school children and people living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
